                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I am deeply concerned about the House Republicans\u2019 reconciliation bill instructing the Energy and Commerce Committee, which has jurisdiction over Medicaid, to find $880 billion in savings over the next 10 years. To accomplish this mandate, heavy cuts to Medicaid coverage or federal cost share with states are expected\u2014if not inevitable. My full statement below \u2b07\ufe0f",
