                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "On National Nurses Day, I send thanks to nurses who show up every day\u00a0for their patients \u2026 even when tired, stressed, and overworked.\u00a0\u00a0You all are incredible!\u00a0\u00a0Caring for others at their most vulnerable time is a vital community service and we commend your experience, patience, and kindness. #NationalNursesDay",
