                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Team McClain Delaney had the privilege of touring the @DaVita in Germantown and seeing firsthand the exceptional care provided to patients with kidney disease. Grateful for the dedication of the team pictured here\u2014including the Director, Charge Nurse, Social Worker, and Dietitian\u2014who go above and beyond every day to deliver lifesaving treatment and holistic support.",
