                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "At @UPMC and Garrett Regional Medical Center this week, I heard directly from doctors, nurses, and patients deeply concerned about the Big Budget Bill.\n\nMedicaid cuts won\u2019t just appear on paper\u2014they\u2019ll be felt in our communities, especially in Western Maryland, which is already a designated physician shortage area.\n\nHealth care should never be partisan. Every child, parent, and senior deserves quality care close to home. I\u2019ll keep working with partners at every level to push back against these cuts and fight for the health of Western Maryland. https://t.co/0VdBiiz72p",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": [
                    "UPMC"
                ],
                "text_tagged_users_ids": [
                    "3844343603"
                ],
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1756405594,
                "view_count": 122
            },
            {
                "attached_links_expanded_url": null,
                "attached_links_url": null,
