                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Rural hospital closures pose a real threat to our country and cuts to Medicaid are recklessly fueling the fire. After closures, patients travel an average of 10 to 20 minutes longer to reach emergency care. Even today, more than one-third of U.S. counties are maternity-care deserts.\n\nMedicaid unpins our health care systems and serves as a lifeline for our rural communities, across the country and right here in Maryland\u2019s 6th. When we stand up to health care cuts, we\u2019re standing up for all Americans \u2014 regardless of how they\u2019re covered.\n\nhttps://t.co/l1pm0tFp1C",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
