                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Last week, I joined my colleagues in introducing the Advancing Women\u2019s Health Coverage Act, a bipartisan bill to update health coverage for those in need of breast reconstruction after a mastectomy. This issue is personal for me as my mother had a double mastectomy while in her 40s and I know how imperative it is that insurance providers never deny access to this critical care and recovery. I'm so proud to co-lead this important legislation during Breast Cancer Awareness Month \u2014 a time when we reaffirm our commitment to furthering prevention and treatment efforts and the race for a cure.\n\nhttps://t.co/P0kAGnL4KN",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
