                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "On the steps of the Capitol, we affirmed: the Senate shutdown deal is unacceptable for the millions of Americans who are already seeing their health care premiums skyrocket for 2026. @HouseDemocrats are standing strong for every family who can\u2019t afford this CR. https://t.co/PujTek908I",
